                                "sense_id": "ceac6687-7a03-316e-9cba-11f68b5f0c30",
                                "text": "being in his owne Countrie, and amidst good friends, he had the better leasure to re-enforce his decayed forces, and more opportunity, to strengthen Townes, to munite Castles, to store Rivers with all necessaries they wanted[…]."
