                                "sense_id": "ceac6687-7a03-316e-9cba-11f68b5f0c30",
                                "text": "Concerning the means of procuring unity, men must beware, that, in the procuring or muniting of religious unity, they do not dissolve and deface the laws of charity and of human society."
